  "starterCode": "def solve(X):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\ndef solve(X):\n    import numpy as np\n    a=np.asarray(X,dtype=float); mu=a.mean(axis=0); sd=a.std(axis=0)\n    sd[sd==0]=1\n    return ((a-mu)/sd).tolist()\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
